MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Dear Jason,

Convert Person to a factor with the levels in the order that you want.

Group_df$Person <- factor(Group_df$Person, levels = c("Them", "You", "Me"))

HTH,

Thierry

