I know a lot of dedicated volunteers pour a tremendous amount work into ggplot2.  I know a lot of us users and non-contributors appreciate the hard work of the folks doing the development, so please do not think that this is question is coming from a lack of appreciation.  This question is motivated more so by curiosity of how the ggplot2 freeware is released to folks.

